# Normalise line endings across platforms.
#
# The repository stores text as LF and Prettier is configured with
# `endOfLine: "lf"`. Without this file a Windows clone (core.autocrlf=true)
# checks everything out as CRLF, so `npm run format:check` fails on every
# file locally while passing on Linux CI. Pinning eol=lf keeps the working
# tree byte-identical to what CI verifies.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
